perience that aligns with the lifestyle of its target audience.\",7\r\n402,2018,The year 2018 marks the launch of Apple Pay in Poland,1\r\n62,GOOGLE PAY,\"Google Pay is a mobile payment system that began its operations in Poland in November 2016. It is widely available across many banks in the country, providing users with a convenient and secure method for making payments using their mobile devices. This service allows users to store their credit and debit card information on their smartphones, enabling them to make contactless payments at various retail locations. By integrating with numerous banking institutions, Google Pay has established itself as a versatile and accessible payment solution for Polish consumers, enhancing the ease of financial transactions in the region.\",9\r\n94,GOOGLE WALLET,,1\r\n95,ANDROID PAY,\"Android Pay is a former name for Google Pay, a mobile payment system for Android devices.\",1\r\n96,GPAY,\"GPay is another former name for Google Pay, a mobile payment system for Android devices.\",1\r\n401,2016,The year 2016 marks the launch of Google Pay in Poland,1\r\n102,GARMIN,\"Garmin Ltd. is a multinational technology company known for its GPS technology and wearable devices, including smartwatches that support Garmin Pay\",1\r\n103,FITBIT,\"Fitbit is a company that produces consumer electronics and fitness devices, including smartwatches and fitness bands that support Fitbit Pay\",1\r\n\n\n-----Relationships-----\nhuman_readable_id,source,target,description,combined_degree\r\n104,HCE,BLIK,Both HCE and BLIK are mobile payment systems that allow contactless transactions using mobile devices,74\r\n409,HCE CARDS,BANKS,Banks in Poland offer HCE cards as a virtual payment solution,29\r\n112,APPLE PAY,GARMIN PAY,Both Apple Pay and Garmin Pay are contactless payment systems that allow users to make payments using wearable devices,17\r\n110,GARMIN PAY,FITBIT PAY,\"Garmin Pay and Fitbit Pay are contactless payment solutions designed for users of Garm